-Yeah, you can't ask that.

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:56.567
-Would people consider you
a scratchy kisser?

00:01:56.567 --> 00:01:58.367
[ Laughter ]
-Um.

00:01:58.367 --> 00:02:01.634
Man, I'd have to ask my wife,
but I'm going to go with no.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:02.968
I'm going to say
I'm a great kisser.

00:02:02.968 --> 00:02:05.734
-Oh.
[ Audience ohs ]

00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:08.534
Great kisser.
-I'm close. It's my turn.

00:02:08.534 --> 00:02:10.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:11.701
-You want me to lean in?
-I'm close --

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:13.601
-You want -- Okay.
-No, you're leaning in enough.

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:14.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:17.534
You look very clean shaven,
I will say, very clean.

00:02:17.534 --> 00:02:20.968
-Okay.
-You got a nice fade.

00:02:20.968 --> 00:02:22.968
It feels like
you're very groomed almost.

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:25.701
-Okay.
-Hm.

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:27.000
-I'm going to say there's
no 'stache under that mask.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.934
-Gonna say no?
I'm going to say yes 'stache.

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:30.534
-Oh, wait, who said --
What's the answers again?

00:02:30.534 --> 00:02:32.033
You said 'stache?
-I'm saying 'stache.

00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:33.267
Quest says 'stache.
-I say 'stache.

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:34.501
-I say no 'stache.

00:02:34.501 --> 00:02:35.667
Michael...
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:39.100
-Is there a 'stache
under that mask?

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.701
-Please reveal.

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:43.334
[ Drum roll continues ]

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:44.701
-Oh, man! [ Laughs ]

00:02:44.701 --> 00:02:45.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:48.801
Damn it! [ Laughs ]

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:51.701
Oh, man!
Really good job, buddy.

00:02:51.701 --> 00:02:53.968
Ah.

00:02:53.968 --> 00:02:57.133
This has been "Is There
a 'Stache Under That Mask?"

